# Deferred transaction rollback uses the standard commit-then-rollback
# idiom: Commit's error is checked explicitly at each site, and the
# deferred Rollback is a no-op (sql.ErrTxDone) after a successful commit.
# The rollback only runs on error paths, where the function's real error
# is already being returned.
